{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a2-practice-24","level":"A2","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"warten auf, sich interessieren für","bn":"Verb + Preposition"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich warte ___ meinen Freund.","options":["für","mit","auf"],"answer":2,"explanation":"warten auf।","id":"a2-practice-24-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er interessiert sich ___ Fußball.","options":["für","auf","an"],"answer":0,"explanation":"sich interessieren für।","id":"a2-practice-24-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"কোন বাক্যটি সঠিক?","options":["Ich schwimmen möchte heute.","Ich möchte heute schwimmen.","Ich möchte schwimmen heute."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Modal verb দ্বিতীয় স্থানে, মূল verb শেষে।","id":"a2-practice-24-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wir müssen heute lange arbeiten.“ বাক্যে মূল কাজের verb কোনটি?","options":["müssen","lange","arbeiten"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-24-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich interessiere mich für Musik.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি সংগীতের প্রতি আগ্রহী।","আমি সংগীত শিখি।","আমি সংগীত পছন্দ করি না।"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-24-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Wettervorhersage“ মানে কী?","options":["জলবায়ু","আবহাওয়ার পূর্বাভাস","আবহাওয়ার পরিবর্তন"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-24-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Heute sind es 30 Grad.“ মানে কী?","options":["আজ ৩০ মিনিট।","আজ ৩০ তারিখ।","আজ ৩০ ডিগ্রি।"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-24-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Mülltonne“ মানে কী?","options":["আবর্জনার পাত্র","ফেরতযোগ্য বোতল","পুরনো কাগজ"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-24-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„der Nebel“ মানে কী?","options":["বরফ","কুয়াশা","ঝড়"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-24-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Sport treiben“ মানে কী?","options":["খেলা কেনা","খেলাধুলা করা","খেলা দেখা"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-24-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Der Ausflug war anstrengend.“ মানে কী?","options":["ভ্রমণটা আরামদায়ক ছিল।","ভ্রমণটা মজার ছিল।","ভ্রমণটা ক্লান্তিকর ছিল।"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-24-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ gestern nicht kommen. (পারিনি)","options":["konnte","könnte","kann"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-24-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„noch nie“ মানে কী?","options":["আর না","কখনোই না","এখনো না"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-24-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ist jemand hier?“ মানে কী?","options":["এখানে কেউ নেই।","এখানে সবাই আছে।","এখানে কি কেউ আছে?"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-24-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich denke oft ___ meine Eltern.","options":["an","auf","für"],"answer":0,"explanation":"denken an।","id":"a2-practice-24-q15"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir sprechen ___ den Urlaub.","options":["mit","über","an"],"answer":1,"explanation":"sprechen über।","id":"a2-practice-24-q16"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich will heute früh schlafen ___.","options":["gehe","gegangen","gehen"],"answer":2,"explanation":"দুটি verb: দ্বিতীয়টি infinitive, শেষে।","id":"a2-practice-24-q17"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wie ist das Wetter heute?“ মানে কী?","options":["আজ আবহাওয়া কেমন?","আজ কী বার?","আজ কয়টা বাজে?"],"answer":0,"explanation":"A1 মনে করুন।","id":"a2-practice-24-q18"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sara schreibt: „Ich interessiere mich sehr für die Natur. Am Wochenende möchte ich im Wald wandern. Ich warte nur auf gutes Wetter.“\nসারা কিসের অপেক্ষা করছে?","options":["ট্রেনের","ভালো আবহাওয়ার","বন্ধুর"],"answer":1,"explanation":"warten auf = অপেক্ষা করা।","id":"a2-practice-24-q19"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Paul: „Ich warte seit einer Stunde auf den Bus. Ich möchte nicht mehr warten!“\nপল কতক্ষণ ধরে অপেক্ষা করছে?","options":["এক ঘণ্টা আগে থেকে না","দশ মিনিট ধরে","এক ঘণ্টা ধরে"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-24-q20"}],"requires":{"grammar":9,"vocabulary":13}},"schema":1,"id":"a2-practice-24","level":"A2","test":[]}